# YOLO model weights (auto-downloaded on first run; don't commit binaries)
*.pt

# ReID checkpoints. Only `*.pt` was ignored before, so src/reid/weights/
# osnet_ain_x1_0.pth (53 MB) is already TRACKED -- left as is, since untracking it
# would break the fresh-clone path that currently gets it for free.
# New checkpoints must not follow it: FastReID's released files are full training
# checkpoints (msmt_sbs_R101-ibn.pth is 537 MB for ~170 MB of parameters), which is
# over GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit -- a push carrying one is REJECTED, not
# merely large. Move them with deploy.sh / scp, the same way yolo11m.pt is handled
# (REMEDIATION_PLAN.md 0.75).
*.pth
!src/reid/weights/osnet_ain_x1_0.pth

